GNU ed 1.22.4 official testsuite
================================

These files (except COPYING, copied from the same tarball, and this
ORIGIN.ed-rs note) are the unmodified testsuite from GNU ed 1.22.4,
copyright the GNU ed authors, licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later (see
COPYING). Official check.sh additionally grants unlimited permission
to copy, distribute, and modify that script.

Upstream tarball: https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/ed/ed-1.22.4.tar.lz
Imported from the official source tree as distributed in the Ubuntu
orig tarball ed_1.22.4.orig.tar.gz (same contents as the upstream
tree; used because this import host had tar --lzip but no lzip binary).
sha256(ed_1.22.4.orig.tar.gz)=
  9b9d7dd462c72563c84dc6043b48187692ca7b902e68a85319e84a4a7da289e0

Do not edit, weaken, delete, or skip the official test files.
Run them with tests/run_gnu_testsuite.sh (or ./check.sh).
